      "cooked": "<p>I think I have this right but just want to verify.</p>\n<p>The first turn that bunker plays recharge mode he draws two cards.</p>\n<p>Every turn afterwords he draws 3 since he neither played a card or power.</p>\n<p>Is this correct?</p>",
