      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-19T23:06:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That’s what I’ve always done.  The rules state that if you do not play or use a power, you may draw two cards.  There is no stiplulation on the reasons why you did not play or use a power, so long as you didn’t skip your turn entirely.  Recharge Mode allows an additional card draw, meaning three cards drawn.</p>",
