      "created_at": "2011-08-20T00:04:50.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Success! You’re both doing it right! Since, while in Recharge Mode, you neither play a card nor use powers, you absolutely get 3 cards per turn, excepting the turn it was played on.</p>",
